Z||000008||Fformula88||08-07-2000||05:35 PM||||Be careful taking the lense off.  I got myself a pair of taillights off a junked Fiero.  One was scratched bad, and the reverse area had yellowed... but they were $10 for the pair so I took them.  My dads coupe had one cracked cover over the lense so I tried to change the covers (due to the yellowing of the reverse area).  That black weatherstripping was too sticky to come apart and I ended up busting the brittle plastic.  It breaks easy so be careful.  Luckily I tried it on the opposite side so I still had the whole taillight to replace the cracked one with.  ||||reg||1
